    {
      "Key": "EDITOR_List_Filter_Input_TT",
      "Text": "Enter a term to filter this list.\n\nSeparate terms with {0} to match all of them (AND).\n\nSeparate terms with {1} to match any of them (OR).\n\nIn lists that colour items by vanilla state, the terms modified and added show only modified or added items, and combine with other terms (e.g. modified{0}c1000)."
